 o won the Jersey City\nComedy Festival\nand has performed on iconic stages 
 including Massey Hall and The\nWilbur. Her debut comedy EP with JFL Origina
 ls airs on SiriusXM\, with a\nJFL Live Sessions recording set for release l
 ater this year. She will be\nfeatured as part of\nThe New Wave of Stand-Up 
 at JFL Vancouver 2026.\n\nAnjelica has opened for Shane Gillis\, Joe List\,
  Stavros Halkias\, Rachel Feinstein\, Tom Green\, Jay Pharoah\, and\nCipha 
 Sounds. On screen\, she’s appeared in Disney’s Camp Rock and Netflix’
 s\nLittle Italy . Her Don’t Tell Comedy and Just For Laughs New Faces set
 s are available online\, and she recently appeared on\nRoast Battle Canada 
 at JFL Montreal.\n\nAges 18+\nFee applies if transferring confirmed ticket 
